==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{term/t|la|diēs||day}} and {{term|Martis|lang=la}}, genitive of {{term|Mars|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{head|la|noun|g=m|head=[[diēs]] [[Martis]]}}

